    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Rekeeresia kamakhuwa kano Baisiraeli basiaase! Yesu owa Nasareti, omundu owe bunyali bwe buwele bubwabonekha abuwaanga khwinywe, mu mayia koosi ne bibiindu bie khuukia nibio Wele aakhola khubirira mu niye, enywe mwabeene mumanyile kano sikila kakholekha ano mwinywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.27.35"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat. 27.35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.15.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mk. 15.24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.23.33"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lk. 23.33",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.19.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yn. 19.18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Khuloondekhana ne khurekekha khwa Wele, Wele aba aabisia khale ali Yesu aliaanwa khwinywe. Ne enywe mwamubaamba khu musalaba mwamwiira khurumikhira babaandu bali enje we lilaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.28.5+MAT.28.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat. 28.5-6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.16.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mk. 16.6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.24.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lk. 24.5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ne kakhali Wele amulamusia khukhwama mu lifwa, amurusia mu bunyali bwalio, sikila abele se kanyalikhana lifwa limutiile nga omuboe tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.16.8+PSA.16.9+PSA.16.10+PSA.16.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Chiny. 16.8-11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Sikila Daudi alomaloma ka Yesu ali,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Bawandaayefwe, khukhwola ese muboolele enywe abuwaanga ka kuuka wefwe owamanyikhana, Omwami Daudi. Aafwa mala aasiikhwa, ne siliindwa siewe sili nafwe ano khukhwola endaalo yino. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.132.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Chiny. 132.11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.7.12+2SA.7.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam. 7.12-13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Aaba omung'oosi, mala aamanya niko Wele amusuubisia. Wele echubila Daudi ali, ‘Alikhola mulala khu be lisaaye liewe abe Omwami nga Daudi ne aba.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi aabona niko Wele aaba ne acha khukhola mu ndaalo chichiicha, nio alomaloma khu lilamukha lia Kristo nga ne aloma ali,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Wele aalamusia Yesu chana oyo khukhwama mu lifwa, ne efwe fweesi khuli baloli khu kano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alamusibwe khuba kumukhono kumuseecha kwa Wele, oli Paapa wewe, mala anyoolile Roho Omutakatifu khukhwama khu niye, nga ne amusubisia. Nisio mulikho mubona luno ne khuulila sili siianwa siewe nisio akhuchukhiile efwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.110.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Chiny. 110.1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Sikila se aaba Daudi owaniina mwikulu tawe, ne kakhali aaloma ali,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nono babaandu ba Isiraeli mwesi mumanye ng'ali muli Yesu yuno, niye enywe mwabambile khu musalaba, ali niye Wele akholile Omwami, lundi Kristo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga baulila bario, bananisibwa mu miooyo, mala baboolela Petero ne barumwa basie bali, “Bawandaayefwe, efwe nono khukhole siina?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Petero abakobosia ali, “Buli mulala khwinywe khukhwola ekanile bubwoni bwewe mala abatiisibwe mu lisina lia Yesu Kristo, nio mubeelwe bubwoni bwenywe, mala mulanyoola siianwa sia Wele, niye Roho Omutakatifu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sikila lisuubisia lia Wele lili khwinywe ne khu baana benywe, ne khu baali aleeyi, boosi nibo Omwami wefwe Wele, akhalaange bamwichekho.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Petero aabekoonjelela ne kamakhuwa kakaandi kamakali ne abachuuba naloma ali, “Khemwionie khukhwama khu sinyaasio sisiicha khu baandu be bubwoni bano!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakali khu nibo basuubila burume bwewe mala babatiisibwa, embi babaandu chielefu chitaru batasikha khu sipupu esio endaalo ng'ene eyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Barumikhira biise biabwe khukhweyika khukhwama khu barumwa, khumenya alala mu busanganilo, ne bakabana biakhulia ne khusaba Wele.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.42"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Limenya mu basuubili",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kamayia ne kamakhuwa ke khuukia kamakali kaba kalikho kekholekha khubirira mu barumwa, mala buuri bwaamba buli mundu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.4.32+ACT.4.33+ACT.4.34+ACT.4.35"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bikh. 4.32-35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Basuubili boosi bachiililila khuba alala mu busanganilo bwa siimbisiimbi ne khukabana kimiaandu kiabwe babeene ne babeene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakusianga kimiaandu kiabwe, mala bakabana chirupia, khuloondekhana ne butinyu bwa buli mundu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakaananilanga mu Lukaangu buli busiele, lundi balilaanga alala mu chingo chabwe. Balichanga ne busangaafu ne kimiooyo kimilayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bafumianga Wele ne khu fukiililwa ne babaandu boosi. Ne buli endaalo Omwami Wele atasaanga khu sipupu siabwe abo ba baonisibwanga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.47"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
